#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:17
msgid "9. Bluetooth Traffic Light"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:26
msgid "Three LEDs stand in for a traffic light. One letter from the phone switches the light: **R** for red, **Y** for yellow, **G** for green."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:29
msgid "This is the first project where the phone sends a **command** instead of text - and it is much shorter than you expect. The sketch looks at single characters, so one letter is already a complete message."
msgstr ""

