msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:57
msgid "Open the Serial Monitor at **115200**. You should read:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:65
msgid "If you read ``[!] no reply from the module``, the module is not answering on D0/D1 - check the four wires and the power supply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:69
msgid "3. Control the Light from the Phone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:71
msgid "Use **LightBlue**, the same app as in the Get Started chapter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:73
msgid "Open LightBlue, tap **Scan** and connect to **SunFounder-C2**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:75
msgid "Expand the service **0xA002** and open the characteristic **C304**. Then tap **Write new value**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:80
msgid "Set the format in the top right corner to **UTF-8 String**, type a single capital ``R`` and send it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:85
msgid "The red LED lights up and the other two go out."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:87
msgid "Send ``Y`` - yellow. Send ``G`` - green."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:89
msgid "One letter is enough, but a longer word is harmless: the sketch only reacts to the characters it knows and ignores the rest. Type ``RED`` and the ``R`` still works."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:92
msgid "A lower-case ``r`` does **not** work - the sketch compares against the capital letters only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/iot_project_espc201/bluetooth_espc201/09-iot_Bluetooth_traffic_light.rst:96
msgid "Watch the Serial Monitor while you send: each received character is printed on its own line, so you can always tell whether the phone reached the board."
msgstr ""

